{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to distant worlds, where every puzzle is a gateway to the unknown.\u00a0 Lose yourself in the meditative rhythm of matching tiles, unlocking new experiences as you explore the realms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock Mystical and Alien Realms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through beautifully crafted realms, each with its own unusual tile sets and atmospheric themes. From tranquil zen spaces to eerie alien worlds, every realm offers a distinct experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Editor &amp; Steam Workshop Integration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own puzzles with the intuitive editor and share them on the Steam Workshop. Browse a growing collection of player-made layouts for endless replayability and challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Music &amp; Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each realm is brought to life with custom music tracks and striking visuals, creating a deep, immersive atmosphere that evolves with your journey.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3284780?t=1757986366","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757986366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/0454b48cfdab2f900ded9830eab12d77c0b04e66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757986366","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/0454b48cfdab2f900ded9830eab12d77c0b04e66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757986366","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3540010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to distant worlds, where every puzzle is a gateway t